{"strongs": "H0146", "word": "אַדָּר", "translit": "ad.dar", "root": "אדן", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "noble ?", "definition": "אַדָּר proper name, masculine ( noble ? ). 1. son of Bela, grandson of Benjm. 1Chr 8:3 (perhaps error — compare Be — for אַרְדְּ q. v. Num 26:40 ; Gen 46:21 ). 2. city in Judah Josh 15:3 ( אַדָּ֫רָה ); = חֲצַר אַדָּר (q. v.) Num 34:4 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB137')\">BDB137</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H146')\">H146</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB136')\">BDB136</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB138')\">BDB138</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַדָּר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>noble ?</highlight>). <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> son of Bela, grandson of Benjm. <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,3)\">1Chr 8:3</ref> (perhaps error — compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> — for  <bdbheb><reflink>אַרְדְּ</reflink></bdbheb> q. v. <ref ref=\"Num 26:40\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,40)\">Num 26:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,21)\">Gen 46:21</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> city in Judah <ref ref=\"Josh 15:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,3)\">Josh 15:3</ref> (<bdbheb>אַדָּ֫רָה</bdbheb>); = <bdbheb>חֲצַר אַדָּר</bdbheb> (q. v.) <ref ref=\"Num 34:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,4)\">Num 34:4</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Chr 8:3", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Num 26:40", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 26, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Gen 46:21", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 46, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Josh 15:3", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 15, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Num 34:4", "boo